      "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 2623 reported a net release of prior year reserves of $150.8 million in 2021. This release was primarily driven by favorable claims development across the 2019 underwriting year, despite adverse impacts from the COVID-19 pandemic and several natural catastrophes including Hurricanes Laura, Sally, Delta, Zeta, Storm Dorian, and Typhoons Faxai and Hagibis. The Property division also saw a significant release, partly due to a Loss Portfolio Transfer for its Engineering classes. The Cyber & Executive Risk division achieved a net release despite increased ransomware claims activity in the 2020 underwriting year.",
